       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CUSTOMER.
       AUTHOR. LEGACY-SYSTEMS-TEAM.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
           COPY COMMON.
           COPY HEADER.
       01 WS-CUSTOMER-ID       PIC 9(8).
       01 WS-CUSTOMER-NAME     PIC X(40).
       01 WS-ACCOUNT-BALANCE   PIC S9(12)V99 COMP-3.
       01 WS-STATUS            PIC X(1).
          88 STATUS-ACTIVE     VALUE 'A'.
          88 STATUS-INACTIVE   VALUE 'I'.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           PERFORM INIT-PARA
           PERFORM READ-CUSTOMER-PARA
           PERFORM PROCESS-CUSTOMER-PARA
           PERFORM CLOSE-PARA
           STOP RUN.

       INIT-PARA.
           CALL 'DBACCESS' USING WS-CUSTOMER-ID WS-STATUS.
           CALL 'LOGGER' USING 'CUSTOMER-INIT'.

       READ-CUSTOMER-PARA.
           CALL 'DBACCESS' USING WS-CUSTOMER-ID WS-CUSTOMER-NAME.
           IF WS-STATUS NOT EQUAL 'OK'
               PERFORM ERROR-PARA
           END-IF.

       PROCESS-CUSTOMER-PARA.
           COPY VALIDATIONS.
           IF STATUS-ACTIVE
               COMPUTE WS-ACCOUNT-BALANCE = WS-ACCOUNT-BALANCE * 1.05
           END-IF.

       ERROR-PARA.
           CALL 'LOGGER' USING 'CUSTOMER-ERROR' WS-STATUS.
           MOVE 'I' TO WS-STATUS.

       CLOSE-PARA.
           CALL 'DBCLOSE'.
